HYGON Contributions

Modified by Hygon Information Technology Co., Ltd.

Hygon's contributions comprise the platform-specific implementation and
integration work for this HCU adaptation: HIP toolchain and architecture
support; attention-kernel data layouts, memory access and scheduling; and
HCU paths for FP8, separate QK/V head dimensions, paged and prefix-cache
attention, explicit masks and sparse attention.

They also include Python and native-interface extensions, backend selection
and dispatch, and the associated build, packaging, test and benchmark
infrastructure maintained for these HCU implementations.

